    "name": "DataConnectionAndQuery.LoggingExtensions.EventIdentifier",
    "kind": "Library",
    "language": "csharp",
    "contract": "Consumers can select one of thirteen event categories by its fixed integer: ConnectionStringBuilt=0, ExpressionTreeCreation=1, MapperSqlParameterNotFound=2, MapperSqlColumnNotFound=3, MapperCacheStatus=4, MapperProcessTrace=5, UnexpectedDbNull=6, MapperResultsReaderInvalid=7, CmdExecuted=8, ConnectRetry=9, CommandRetry=10, CircuitBreaker=11, or BatchStep=12. Each selection identifies that category rather than another category."
  },
